            {
              "type": "SystemMessagePromptTemplate",
              "message": "You triage blockers raised at a team's daily standup. Return: actionable, true when someone other than the person who raised it can act to unblock it, false for status notes or things that will clear on their own; category, one of dependency, decision, access, technical or other; title, an issue title under 80 characters that says what is needed. Use only what the update says."
            }
          ]
        },
        "hasOutputParser": true
      }
